    {
      "id": "faq",
      "type": "sharedSection",
      "props": {
        "sectionId": "faq-band",
        "values": {
          "eyebrow": "Questions dealers ask",
          "heading": "Buzznerd products, answered",
          "faqs": [
            {
              "q": "Which product should I start with?",
              "a": "Most dealers start with an AI Website — it's the front door where leads come in. Add AI E-Commerce and the AI Platform whenever you're ready; all three run on the same AI and your live inventory, so nothing gets rebuilt later."
            },
            {
              "q": "Do the three products work together?",
              "a": "Yes. Every product shares one inventory feed, one customer record and one AI. Website leads flow into the platform, ecommerce orders land in the same place, and channel-to-sale attribution ties it all back to the sold unit — no double entry, no data silos."
            },
            {
              "q": "What systems does Buzznerd integrate with?",
              "a": "Buzznerd works with Karmak, CDK and major DMS/CRM platforms, pulls inventory and market data from marketplaces like Truck Paper and Machinery Trader, and connects to Google, Meta and Stripe. Custom DMS and ERP integrations are available."
            },
            {
              "q": "Can I sell parts and products online nationwide?",
              "a": "Yes. AI E-Commerce is a storefront built for dealership complexity — 24/7 nationwide selling with account-based pricing, shipping rules and secure Stripe checkout that closes deals while the counter is dark."
            },
            {
              "q": "What is the AI Platform?",
              "a": "The AI Platform is the AI under everything Buzznerd builds — answering leads after hours, handing reps a ranked No-Touch CRM morning digest, building listings from a photo with Magic Flow, and tracing every channel to the sold unit."
            },
            {
              "q": "How do I see how my dealership shows up in AI search?",
              "a": "Run the free AI Presence Score. It scans your dealership and shows how you rank across AEO, AIO, SEO and GEO — the same Magic 8 signals Buzznerd optimizes."
            }
          ]
        },
        "snapshots": {
